---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Buyer Pack | Published BitEvo Scope & Evidence" description="A procurement reading list of existing BitEvo audit scope, sample evidence, security, privacy, pricing and starting points." alternates={{ en: '/buyer-pack', ru: '/ru/buyer-pack' }}>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow">
    <div class="eyebrow">Procurement · Public materials only</div>
    <h1 class="display">Buyer pack: what is publicly documented</h1>
    <p class="lede">A route to existing facts, not a new legal, security or commercial attestation. Use the linked pages to assess a bounded engagement; request any unavailable facts directly before procurement approval.</p>
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Scope and commercial terms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/entry-audit">Entry Audit</a> — one action chain and one primary control or failure hypothesis, tested in staging/test, evidence limits and published fixed price.</li>
        <li><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> — currently published scope and pricing.</li>
        <li><a href="/start">Start</a> — paths to choose and prepare a scope.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Evidence and public safeguards</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/sample-audit">Sample audit</a> — an example of bounded reporting, not evidence of a client engagement.</li>
        <li><a href="/security">Security</a> — publicly stated access and testing boundaries.</li>
        <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> — published site-data and event handling information.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This page provides no company registration, tax or invoice details, insurance assurance, DPA promise or certification. No engagement is authorized until terms and scope are agreed in writing.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
